-- zrbfacore: Darkmoon Faire quests that could be taken but not finished (Four, 2026-11-06).
-- Goes with the updated tools/bfa/darkmoon-faire-gossip.patch (Test Your Strength). Positions
-- and chances are from the Pandaria 5.4.8 world DB. Safe to run more than once.
--
-- 1. Spoilin' for Salty Sea Dogs (29513): the Salty Sea Dog (73269) was in no fishing loot.
--    Darkmoon Island (zone 5861) had no fishing loot at all, so the core used its default fish.
--    Now a player on the quest catches a Salty Sea Dog 30% of the time in the island's waters
--    (Pandaria: 20.9%); everyone else still gets the default fish (the core falls back to it
--    when nothing drops from the zone's own table).
DELETE FROM `fishing_loot_template` WHERE `Entry`=5861 AND `Item`=73269;

-- 2. Tan My Hide (29519): the Staked Skins (209276) were never placed. 19 skins around the
--    tents, as in the Pandaria DB (guids 974000003-974000021).
-- 3. Master Pit Fighter (29761): Pit Fighter (74034) only comes from the Darkmoon Treasure Chest
--    (209620, loot 40419, 95%), which was never placed. One chest in the Deathmatch pit, back
--    2 hours after it is looted (Pandaria value), guid 974000022.
DELETE FROM `gameobject` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 974000003 AND 974000022;
